# logs screen-empty --------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: the Logs screen. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13, less$
# installed. The file is there and empty: what main()'s open$
# leaves on a first start, before anything is logged$
# (logging.go:38).$
$
# Logs #########################################################$
$
# Log ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  File                 /var/log/hardn.log$
   -  Empty$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Refresh              Read the log again$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

